WEBVTT

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.402
Bear to port.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:15.582
If you're planning
on getting eaten,

00:00:15.757 --> 00:00:19.412
I'd definitely go
with the Gronckle.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:23.329
You were wise to seek help
from the world's
most deadly weapon.

00:00:23.503 --> 00:00:25.027
- Uh...
- It's me.

00:00:25.201 --> 00:00:27.464
- I love this plan.
- I didn't...

00:00:27.638 --> 00:00:30.206
You're crazy.
[whispers] I like that.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.470
So, what is the plan?

00:00:43.306 --> 00:00:46.439
- That's not
really encouraging.
- Oh.

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:49.573
[chuckles] I was wondering
where that went.

00:00:53.272 --> 00:00:54.926
[chains rattle]

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.233
[sniffing]

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:04.544
- [clamor]
- Stay low and ready
your weapons.

00:01:07.765 --> 00:01:09.680
[growls, roars]

00:01:13.292 --> 00:01:16.382
[animal noises, distant]

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:21.736
We're here.

00:01:24.608 --> 00:01:26.392
[animal noises stop]

00:01:31.876 --> 00:01:33.660
[exhales]

00:01:36.402 --> 00:01:39.231
- [gasps]
- Oh...

00:01:46.151 --> 00:01:47.457
Uh-uh.

00:01:54.812 --> 00:01:57.206
- Wait! What are you...?
- Shh! Relax.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.599
It's OK. It's OK.

00:02:03.516 --> 00:02:05.736
[guttural purr]

00:02:10.872 --> 00:02:12.482
Where are you going?

00:02:12.656 --> 00:02:14.789
You're gonna need something
to help you hold on.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:28.585
When we crack this mountain
open, all hell is going
to break loose.

00:02:28.759 --> 00:02:31.544
In my undies. Good thing
I brought extras.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:34.460
No matter how this ends,
it ends today.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.342
- [rumbling]
- [stone cracking]

00:02:46.516 --> 00:02:48.648
[Vikings cheering, distant]

00:03:01.574 --> 00:03:03.663
[dragons shrieking, growling]

00:03:06.536 --> 00:03:09.582
- [screams]
- [dragons roaring]

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.512
[whimpering growl]

00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:31.735
Is that it?

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:39.351
- [Gobber] We've done it!
- [cheering]

00:03:39.525 --> 00:03:41.876
[dragon roaring, muted]

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:50.319
This isn't over!
Form your ranks!
Hold together!

00:03:50.493 --> 00:03:53.278
- [rumbling]
- [cracking]

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.760
[dragon roaring]

00:03:58.022 --> 00:04:00.459
[dragon snarling]

00:04:03.593 --> 00:04:05.638
- Get clear!
- [gasps]

00:04:11.644 --> 00:04:13.777
- [growling]
- [Vikings yelling]

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:17.694
Beard of Thor!
What is that?!

00:04:21.611 --> 00:04:23.352
Odin help us.

00:04:23.526 --> 00:04:26.746
[roaring]

00:04:28.574 --> 00:04:30.794
- Catapults!
- [man] Fire!

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:41.761
- Get to the ships!
- No! No!

00:04:45.374 --> 00:04:46.766
[Vikings screaming]

00:04:52.598 --> 00:04:54.470
[roars]

00:04:54.644 --> 00:04:56.515
- Smart, that one.
- I was a fool.

00:04:56.689 --> 00:04:58.517
Lead the men to the far side
of the island!

00:04:58.691 --> 00:05:00.519
- Right!
- Gobber, go with the men!

00:05:00.693 --> 00:05:03.044
I think I'll stay,
in case your thinking
doing something crazy.

00:05:03.218 --> 00:05:06.656
I can buy them a few minutes
if I give that thing
someone to hunt!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.397
Then I can double that time.

00:05:10.616 --> 00:05:11.748
Here!

00:05:11.922 --> 00:05:13.968
Oh, no! Here!

00:05:22.846 --> 00:05:27.329
- [snarling]
- Come on! Fight me!

00:05:27.503 --> 00:05:29.722
- No, me!
- [growls]

00:05:32.595 --> 00:05:34.814
- [dragons roaring]
- [roars]

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:38.383
Ruff, Tuff!
Watch your backs!

00:05:38.557 --> 00:05:40.777
Move, Fishlegs!

00:05:40.951 --> 00:05:44.868
[Tuffnut] Look at us!
We're on a dragon.
We're on dragons! All of us!

00:05:46.652 --> 00:05:48.524
[Hiccup] Up!
Let's move it!

00:05:48.698 --> 00:05:53.746
Every bit the boar-headed
stubborn Viking
you ever were!

00:05:55.052 --> 00:05:57.272
- Fishlegs, break it down!
- OK.

00:05:57.446 --> 00:05:59.578
Heavily armored skull and tail
made for bashing and crushing!

00:05:59.752 --> 00:06:01.580
Steer clear of both.

00:06:01.754 --> 00:06:04.714
Small eyes, large nostrils!
Relies on hearing and smell!

00:06:04.888 --> 00:06:08.457
OK, Lout, Legs! Hang in
its blind spot, make noise,
keep it confused!

00:06:08.631 --> 00:06:11.590
Ruff, Tuff, find out
if it has a shot limit!
Make it mad!

00:06:11.764 --> 00:06:13.505
That's my specialty!

00:06:13.679 --> 00:06:16.639
Since when?! Everyone knows
I'm more irritating! See?

00:06:16.813 --> 00:06:19.990
Just do what I told you!
I'll be back as soon as I can!

00:06:20.164 --> 00:06:21.861
[Tuffnut] Don't worry!
We got it covered!

00:06:22.036 --> 00:06:23.950
- [Fishlegs] Yeah!
- [Ruffnut] Whoo!

00:06:31.741 --> 00:06:33.134
- Troll!
- Butt elf!

00:06:33.308 --> 00:06:35.049
- Bride of Grendel!
- [Ruffnut laughs]

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.013
Um, this thing
doesn't have a blind spot!

00:06:43.187 --> 00:06:45.015
[Toothless roaring]

00:06:45.842 --> 00:06:46.886
There!

00:06:55.156 --> 00:06:56.592
Go help the others!

00:06:58.463 --> 00:06:59.943
OK, hold on. Hold on.

00:07:03.773 --> 00:07:05.905
- It's working!
- Yeah, it's working!

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:09.083
[dragons snarling]

00:07:12.608 --> 00:07:13.696
Whoa!

00:07:15.741 --> 00:07:18.962
I've lost power on
the Gronckle! Snotlout,
do something!

00:07:22.226 --> 00:07:24.315
- I'm OK!
- [Gronckle groans]

00:07:24.489 --> 00:07:25.925
[muffled] Less OK!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.757
I can't miss!
What's wrong, buddy?
Something in your eye?

00:07:31.931 --> 00:07:35.065
- [roaring]
- [Fishlegs screaming]

00:07:36.284 --> 00:07:38.068
Yeah! You're the Viking!

00:07:40.679 --> 00:07:42.116
Aaah!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.944
Hey! Whoa!

00:07:53.692 --> 00:07:54.954
[roars]

00:08:08.185 --> 00:08:09.534
[roaring]

00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:11.710
[gasps]

00:08:13.147 --> 00:08:14.974
[coughs]

00:08:15.627 --> 00:08:16.976
Dad?

